5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,We need a structure that is sustainable but doesn't create unnecessary friction. I'll look into the sign-up records for mid-year joiners and the taster evening forms from non-joiners.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I believe we should be mindful of the administrative burden this structure imposes. I'll examine the outgoing treasurer's logged hours and the rota against the attendance record.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I want to understand the actual engagement levels of our members. I'll look into the tally of the sign-in sheets and the rota against the attendance record.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,I'm more interested in why the energy has shifted lately. I'll check the weekday turnout since the summer outings and the quieter members at the winter social.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Takumi,,I'm tired of guessing the numbers like we did last time. I'll check the last year's ledger of outgoings and the bank statements on last year's renewals to see what we actually have.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
